{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.QMomentumProperties","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.QMomentumProperties","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qMomentumP_additive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qMomentumP_additive","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum-properties.lean#L25-L53","doc":"**Additivity of q-momentum under braid concatenation.**\n\n`p_q(β₁β₂) = p_q(β₁) + p_q(β₂)`, encoded at the level of crossing-\nsign lists as `qMomentumP q (s₁ ++ s₂) = qMomentumP q s₁ +\nqMomentumP q s₂`.  Follows from the trace being additive on the\nIwahori–Hecke algebra; the foldl-decomposition is in the companion\n`QMomentum` file. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-momentum-properties","label":"prop:q-momentum-properties","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum-properties.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qMomentumP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qMomentumP","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum-properties.lean#L18-L23","doc":"The q-momentum of a braid, computed from its crossing signs\n(mirror of `QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}